WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 25]

01:36.679 --> 01:37.800
Ling'er.

01:38.720 --> 01:39.800
Ling'er.

01:43.519 --> 01:45.360
Ling'er, where are you?

01:58.560 --> 02:00.080
Is she leaving so soon?

02:10.920 --> 02:12.539
I had someone to ask your servant.

02:12.559 --> 02:13.890
They said you like perilla soup.

02:13.910 --> 02:15.580
My men learned
how to cook this from them.

02:15.600 --> 02:16.880
How does it taste?

02:17.320 --> 02:19.720
The Ye family is in charge
of the Capital's defense.

02:19.800 --> 02:22.379
They will come looking for me
once they find out I have disappeared.

02:22.399 --> 02:23.720
You didn't disappear.

02:24.350 --> 02:26.020
You left the Capital
for an urgent matter

02:26.040 --> 02:27.799
and left a letter.

02:28.959 --> 02:30.199
What letter?

02:33.220 --> 02:34.759
You imitated my handwriting?

02:39.280 --> 02:40.560
She doesn't want this.

02:51.839 --> 02:53.479
Why did you capture me?

02:53.679 --> 02:55.439
I'm worried you would tell Wan'er

02:55.439 --> 02:58.680
that Fan Xian is related
to Lin Gong's death.

02:59.880 --> 03:01.259
Don't be impulsive.

03:01.279 --> 03:02.519
You can't do this to your friend.

03:02.530 --> 03:05.150
How could she get married
if you were to tell her that in advance?

03:06.439 --> 03:08.199
You are the fine one to talk.

03:08.600 --> 03:10.740
You are planning to expose this
at the wedding.

03:10.760 --> 03:12.219
Why do you not trust me?

03:12.239 --> 03:13.519
Why do you think?

03:17.800 --> 03:20.499
Don't you think the strip is a bit long?

03:20.519 --> 03:21.439
Yeah, right.

03:21.439 --> 03:22.679
I think this piece is quite nice.

03:22.679 --> 03:24.239
This should be of the best quality.

03:24.239 --> 03:25.219
Best quality.

03:25.239 --> 03:26.340
What do you think?

03:26.360 --> 03:27.680
Not bad.

03:27.760 --> 03:28.659
No one is asking you.

03:28.679 --> 03:29.919
Why did you come here?

03:30.679 --> 03:31.860
He came here for me.

03:31.880 --> 03:33.180
He wants to speak to me.

03:33.200 --> 03:33.819
Don't go.

03:33.839 --> 03:34.499
I'm not in a hurry.

03:34.519 --> 03:35.919
Go ahead.

03:36.239 --> 03:38.239
Finish it quickly. We have to continue.

03:38.559 --> 03:39.620
What's it?

03:39.640 --> 03:40.819
Father sends for you.

03:40.839 --> 03:41.740
I will go right away.

03:41.760 --> 03:42.800
It's fine. Yours is more important.

03:42.800 --> 03:43.860
He is not in a hurry.

03:43.880 --> 03:45.440
But I am.

03:50.080 --> 03:51.160
Father.

03:51.239 --> 03:52.319
Father.

03:52.679 --> 03:53.759
Did you ask for me?

04:09.439 --> 04:10.900
It fits you really well.

04:10.920 --> 04:12.020
If you say so,

04:12.040 --> 04:12.760
I will take this.

04:12.760 --> 04:14.860
No, I didn't say that.

04:14.880 --> 04:16.299
What I said doesn't matter.

04:16.319 --> 04:18.659
I can't stand it anymore.

04:18.679 --> 04:21.360
There are so many boxes of gowns left.

04:21.480 --> 04:24.560
You should be well-prepared
for the big event in life.

04:25.800 --> 04:26.500
No,

04:26.520 --> 04:28.480
I just don't see the difference

04:28.480 --> 04:30.159
between those gowns.

04:31.239 --> 04:33.159
Exactly.

04:35.079 --> 04:36.619
Did you try on so many gowns back then?

04:36.639 --> 04:38.560
Mine was more than yours.

04:38.759 --> 04:40.360
How did you manage that?

04:42.239 --> 04:44.199
I simply survived the torture.

04:53.360 --> 04:55.159
Why are you sighing?

04:56.759 --> 04:57.820
I was thinking

04:57.840 --> 05:00.079
that ordinary people
don't have the opportunity

05:00.079 --> 05:01.680
to try on so many gowns like you do.

05:01.800 --> 05:04.839
Your annoyance is actually
someone else's happiness.

05:09.840 --> 05:11.019
Did I say something wrong?

05:11.039 --> 05:12.159
Wait,

05:12.480 --> 05:14.140
are you really Fan Sizhe?

05:14.160 --> 05:15.959
I actually heard that from your mouth.

05:17.720 --> 05:18.800
I have witnessed a lot

05:18.800 --> 05:20.219
when I traveled northward.

05:20.239 --> 05:22.140
The Qing State
may considered a rich country,

05:22.160 --> 05:23.679
but there are still many people

05:23.679 --> 05:25.040
who are starving.

05:27.079 --> 05:28.199
So?

05:29.480 --> 05:30.880
So

05:31.160 --> 05:32.959
I want to make more money.

05:35.840 --> 05:38.279
I will open as many stores as possible

05:38.520 --> 05:40.219
across the world,

05:40.239 --> 05:41.679
like in Qing State, Northern Qi,

05:41.679 --> 05:43.580
or even in Dongyi City.

05:43.600 --> 05:44.679
With this wide expansion,

05:44.679 --> 05:46.010
I can hire more people.

05:46.030 --> 05:47.780
I didn't think it too ambitiously
or too far ahead.

05:47.800 --> 05:50.240
I just want to make sure
everyone can fill their hunger.

05:51.239 --> 05:52.599
Rightfully so.

05:53.439 --> 05:55.759
Making money alone isn't enough.

05:56.280 --> 05:58.079
You have grown mature

05:58.360 --> 05:59.920
by giving thought to this.

06:04.639 --> 06:05.800
Fan Xian,

06:05.960 --> 06:09.240
here is something
you need to consider yourself.

06:09.400 --> 06:12.739
The news of your wedding
has stirred up the entire Capital

06:12.759 --> 06:14.539
due to your fame as the Immortal Poet

06:14.559 --> 06:15.530
as well as

06:15.550 --> 06:17.140
your takeover of the Imperial Treasury.

06:17.160 --> 06:18.340
Besides,

06:18.360 --> 06:20.219
His Majesty appointed this marriage.

06:20.239 --> 06:21.639
All the court officials

06:21.639 --> 06:24.920
are waiting to come
to deliver their blessings.

06:25.160 --> 06:26.820
Our house is too small

06:26.840 --> 06:29.120
to receive all of them.

06:29.199 --> 06:30.580
What do you think

06:30.600 --> 06:32.159
about the wedding guest list?

06:33.332 --> 06:34.800
I have to remind you this.

06:34.840 --> 06:36.539
It's easy to decide who you invite.

06:36.559 --> 06:39.079
But those who are left out

06:40.559 --> 06:43.399
might hold grudges

06:43.679 --> 06:46.599
and stab you in the back.

06:49.960 --> 06:51.040
Xian.

06:53.439 --> 06:55.800
Convince Father
that the auction would work.

07:02.439 --> 07:05.440
No matter who I invite or not,

07:05.720 --> 07:06.859
it's controversial.

07:06.879 --> 07:08.519
That's right.

07:09.999 --> 07:11.719
If so, I will invite no one.

07:12.600 --> 07:15.360
The wedding can't be held
without a banquet.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.080
It's a family banquet.

07:17.920 --> 07:19.099
Family banquet?

07:19.119 --> 07:20.199
Family banquet?

07:22.160 --> 07:23.299
Bravo!

07:23.319 --> 07:27.199
The carriage is here.

07:27.400 --> 07:28.839
Magnificent.

07:30.439 --> 07:31.720
The flower carriage is beautiful.

07:31.720 --> 07:33.299
The flower carriage is here.

07:33.319 --> 07:35.880
So beautifully decorated.

07:36.239 --> 07:38.159
The flower carriage is coming this way.

07:38.199 --> 07:39.719
What a flower carriage.

07:39.840 --> 07:42.040
So beautiful.

07:46.559 --> 07:48.040
It's fragrant.

07:49.759 --> 07:52.820
[Fan's Residence]
Little Xian!

07:52.840 --> 07:53.879
- Over there!
- Slow down.

07:53.879 --> 07:54.700
It's really coming.

07:54.720 --> 07:56.079
The big thing over there

07:56.079 --> 07:56.920
is so beautiful.

07:56.920 --> 07:58.179
They all say it's coming for you.

07:58.199 --> 07:59.480
Do you know that?

08:00.360 --> 08:02.360
I will go check it out for you.

08:06.079 --> 08:09.120
Do they spread the petals
all the way from Xinyang to here?

08:09.999 --> 08:12.320
Day and night. Night and day.

08:12.439 --> 08:13.759
Without rest?

08:14.600 --> 08:16.599
They work in shifts.

08:17.199 --> 08:19.659
The flower petals must be a lot.
Can the carriage carry so much?

08:19.679 --> 08:21.120
They pluck petals

08:21.160 --> 08:22.399
along the way.

08:22.639 --> 08:25.120
I wonder how many mountains
have become bare.

08:27.160 --> 08:29.160
I chucked her out of the Capital,

08:29.160 --> 08:32.440
yet she returns here publicly
bearing gifts for me.

08:33.359 --> 08:36.839
After all, she's Princess Lin's mother.

08:37.559 --> 08:39.100
I doubt

08:39.120 --> 08:40.800
if she would be so kind.

08:41.160 --> 08:41.740
It's here.

08:41.760 --> 08:42.659
It's here.

08:42.679 --> 08:44.239
It's coming.

08:47.040 --> 08:48.359
It's coming. Hurry.

08:50.240 --> 08:51.680
Look at those fresh flowers.

08:52.280 --> 08:53.579
So lovely.

08:53.599 --> 08:55.160
Magnificent.

08:56.800 --> 08:58.280
Look at this.

08:59.360 --> 09:00.599
I have never seen something like this.

09:00.599 --> 09:02.320
It smells great.

09:03.199 --> 09:04.920
So fragrant.

09:05.000 --> 09:06.459
Who made this?

09:06.479 --> 09:08.440
I haven't seen one in my dream.

09:16.199 --> 09:17.640
It's my first time.

09:21.079 --> 09:22.479
What does it mean?

09:41.760 --> 09:43.119
It has been a long while.

09:54.679 --> 09:56.839
You are grounded in Xinyang.

09:57.240 --> 09:58.760
You shouldn't return here
without a decree.

09:58.760 --> 10:00.079
I defied the decree.

10:00.640 --> 10:02.359
I came back here secretly.

10:02.800 --> 10:04.260
Report me now.

10:04.280 --> 10:05.260
I'm sure it works.

10:05.280 --> 10:07.059
Why did you come back to the Capital?

10:07.079 --> 10:08.239
This is for you.

10:11.280 --> 10:12.360
Don't be afraid.

10:13.000 --> 10:14.760
This is a wedding gift from me.

10:18.675 --> 10:20.020
[Imperial Treasury Ledgers]

10:20.040 --> 10:22.239
You are going to take over
the Imperial Treasury

10:22.439 --> 10:24.320
after marrying Wan'er.

10:25.990 --> 10:28.119
Are these the ledgers
of the Imperial Treasury?

10:30.479 --> 10:32.119
It's a sincere gift, isn't it?

10:34.199 --> 10:35.579
Did you defy the decree and return here

10:35.599 --> 10:37.119
just for this?

10:37.599 --> 10:39.160
On your wedding day,

10:40.199 --> 10:41.680
I wish to see Wan'er.

10:43.679 --> 10:45.280
She is my daughter.

10:48.559 --> 10:51.560
The wedding is the biggest day for her.

10:52.839 --> 10:54.920
I have never lived a life like hers,

10:55.079 --> 10:56.800
but I hope she does.

10:57.880 --> 11:00.440
Besides, I want to leave her
with the best memories.

11:03.240 --> 11:05.079
So during the wedding,

11:05.359 --> 11:06.640
I call a truce.

11:12.800 --> 11:14.199
And after the wedding?

11:15.160 --> 11:16.440
What a question.

11:16.959 --> 11:18.280
The fierce fight resumes.

11:21.640 --> 11:23.239
Have you ever considered

11:24.120 --> 11:25.440
that I said no?

11:26.479 --> 11:27.879
Like I said,

11:28.079 --> 11:29.440
you can report me.

11:30.640 --> 11:32.800
I only want to do what I want.

11:34.040 --> 11:35.560
Whatever your choice is,

11:35.599 --> 11:36.920
I'm ready for it.

11:38.479 --> 11:39.959
How long will you stay?

11:42.599 --> 11:43.490
It depends on my mood.

11:43.510 --> 11:44.419
Where do you stay?

11:44.439 --> 11:46.119
Not the Fan's Residence, anyway.

11:47.270 --> 11:48.910
Get yourself a good hiding spot.

11:50.640 --> 11:52.560
You should call me "mother",
shouldn't you?

12:18.000 --> 12:19.119
Read slowly.

12:19.240 --> 12:20.830
Don't read in bright light.
Just take your time.

12:20.850 --> 12:21.505
[In the 61st year of the Qing,
in debt of 730,000 taels.]

12:21.506 --> 12:21.959
[In the 62nd year of the Qing,
in debt of 670,000 taels]

12:21.959 --> 12:23.320
I'm good.

12:24.359 --> 12:25.760
I finished it.

12:28.559 --> 12:29.639
What's your read on this?

12:33.040 --> 12:33.920
The establishment
of the Imperial Treasury

12:33.920 --> 12:36.699
is an irreplicable legend.

12:36.719 --> 12:39.760
After all, it was once
the greatest enterprise in the world.

12:40.640 --> 12:41.699
You could confidently say

12:41.719 --> 12:44.599
it's the greatest enterprise ever
in history.

12:44.839 --> 12:46.659
What a brilliant idea

12:46.679 --> 12:49.440
to branch out worldwide

12:51.599 --> 12:53.560
and secure support
from the royal family.

12:54.319 --> 12:55.679
But now it appears

12:55.679 --> 12:59.440
to have over 20 million taels of debt.

12:59.880 --> 13:04.800
Li Yunrui should be executed
for having messed up this business.

13:05.280 --> 13:08.220
It's not easy to kill a royal, though.

13:08.240 --> 13:10.879
Aren't you surprised by this debt?

13:12.359 --> 13:13.800
I should've predicted this.

13:14.000 --> 13:15.220
Even without any existing debt,

13:15.240 --> 13:17.100
it would incur great debt
when handed over to me.

13:17.120 --> 13:18.800
To you,

13:18.800 --> 13:20.820
[Come and meet me instantly]
these aren't just ledgers,

13:21.160 --> 13:22.560
but also a trap.

13:23.359 --> 13:24.339
Even so,

13:24.359 --> 13:26.140
I will fall into it
only after the wedding.

13:26.160 --> 13:27.440
You are right.

13:27.640 --> 13:30.440
The wedding is
the most important matter now.

13:30.839 --> 13:32.880
Your mother also
looked forward to this day.

13:34.160 --> 13:36.760
Should I hide these ledgers
for the time being?

13:37.040 --> 13:38.160
I doubt it.

13:39.040 --> 13:41.079
She arrived in the sight of all.

13:41.479 --> 13:42.800
You should act frankly.

13:43.559 --> 13:44.500
Frankly?

13:44.520 --> 13:46.839
Inform the Eight Division
to copy these ledgers.

13:46.870 --> 13:47.999
It's also time

13:48.400 --> 13:50.760
to make good use
of your mother's invention.

13:59.875 --> 14:01.590
[Eighth Division, Seventh Division]

14:01.959 --> 14:02.970
To whom should we present

14:02.990 --> 14:04.179
the copies afterward?

14:04.199 --> 14:06.640
Anyone who needs to see them.

14:11.390 --> 14:13.179
The Imperial Treasury
is far from a deficit.

14:13.199 --> 14:14.900
Plus, Fan Xian has a brain on him.

14:14.920 --> 14:16.659
I guess the shortfall could be covered

14:16.679 --> 14:18.280
in four to five years.

14:19.280 --> 14:22.400
The ledgers were delivered here
so openly

14:23.120 --> 14:24.599
that those who are concerned

14:25.839 --> 14:27.160
have been alerted.

14:27.880 --> 14:29.740
Merchants

14:29.760 --> 14:31.320
only pursue profits.

14:31.839 --> 14:33.719
Since they know about the debt,

14:34.120 --> 14:36.699
no one would dare
to do business with Fan Xian.

14:36.719 --> 14:38.280
The shortfall

14:38.760 --> 14:40.719
will snowball.

14:41.439 --> 14:44.640
If nothing is done within six months,

14:46.160 --> 14:48.839
he will have to give up
on the Imperial Treasury.

14:53.439 --> 14:54.999
Filling up 20 million taels

14:55.599 --> 14:56.999
in six months

14:58.040 --> 15:00.800
is beyond what an immortal could do.

15:03.400 --> 15:04.640
Unless

15:06.800 --> 15:08.280
someone helps him.

15:11.319 --> 15:13.320
After Fan Xian entered the Capital,

15:13.839 --> 15:16.140
did he offer his service

15:16.160 --> 15:18.359
to you?

15:19.079 --> 15:20.159
Not yet.

15:25.120 --> 15:28.400
You may use this debt

15:29.199 --> 15:31.359
as a term.

15:32.440 --> 15:33.999
It's not too much to ask, right?

15:36.880 --> 15:38.560
You can save his life.

15:57.479 --> 15:59.579
Only a few will save you,

15:59.599 --> 16:02.079
but many will hit you when you are down.

16:04.000 --> 16:05.760
After all, the figure is enormous.

16:08.679 --> 16:10.539
Are both of your eyes unable
to read well?

16:10.559 --> 16:12.040
No, only this.

16:14.559 --> 16:15.980
It's presbyopia.

16:16.000 --> 16:17.719
Aren't you worried

16:19.000 --> 16:20.800
about the debt at all?

16:20.870 --> 16:22.260
I'm not going to think about it

16:22.280 --> 16:23.179
until my wedding is over.

16:23.199 --> 16:24.400
Don't worry.

16:24.719 --> 16:25.980
Regarding the debt,

16:26.000 --> 16:27.500
His Majesty is aware of it. So am I.

16:27.520 --> 16:28.839
I have no worries.

16:28.920 --> 16:30.380
In fact, I didn't come here

16:30.400 --> 16:31.860
only for this.

16:31.880 --> 16:34.420
Wang Qinian told me
about the serial killer.

16:34.440 --> 16:35.659
Did you find out who the murderer is?

16:35.679 --> 16:37.820
I thought you would come that day.

16:37.840 --> 16:39.879
I don't think
this can be discussed openly.

16:40.199 --> 16:41.359
Otherwise, you wouldn't have tasked

16:41.359 --> 16:43.079
Wang Qinian with that
instead of me.

16:43.240 --> 16:46.040
You have the potential
to be an official.

16:46.359 --> 16:47.620
Was it done by Mr. Wuzhu?

16:47.640 --> 16:48.720
I don't know.

16:48.960 --> 16:51.020
This person killed all his way
from Jiangnan to the Capital.

16:51.040 --> 16:53.120
Whoever saw his face was killed.

16:53.140 --> 16:54.260
Did anything happen these days?

16:54.280 --> 16:56.490
The Capital has been peaceful
for the past few days.

16:56.880 --> 16:59.520
It seems the murderer has disappeared.

17:00.280 --> 17:01.599
If so, it wouldn't be him.

17:01.640 --> 17:03.339
Wuzhu has forgotten many things.

17:03.359 --> 17:05.439
What if this were to happen again

17:05.480 --> 17:07.639
and he forgot you

17:07.839 --> 17:09.560
and even attacked you?

17:09.720 --> 17:11.040
What would you do?

17:12.520 --> 17:14.299
I will figure something out

17:14.319 --> 17:15.379
to treat your eyesight.

17:15.399 --> 17:17.359
What would you do

17:17.520 --> 17:18.720
if it's really him?

17:19.079 --> 17:20.679
Will you come to my wedding?

17:25.040 --> 17:26.720
It's your family banquet.

17:28.240 --> 17:30.919
That's why I'm inviting you.

17:33.680 --> 17:36.240
I have long lost my family.

17:37.720 --> 17:39.240
You have me, no?

17:53.150 --> 17:55.240
We will figure something out
after the wedding.

17:56.839 --> 17:57.819
Is this a wedding gift?

17:57.839 --> 17:59.520
I can't go without gifts,

17:59.639 --> 18:00.760
can I?

18:04.800 --> 18:07.180
What's inside? So secretive.

18:07.200 --> 18:09.159
I wish you a happy

18:09.720 --> 18:11.760
and everlasting marriage.

19:32.119 --> 19:33.399
What a beauty.

19:36.599 --> 19:37.500
Mother.

19:37.520 --> 19:38.600
Sit still.

19:40.040 --> 19:42.760
Let me groom you today.

19:45.079 --> 19:46.800
When did you come back here?

19:48.520 --> 19:49.879
I returned secretly.

19:50.280 --> 19:51.579
Without His Majesty's decree?

19:51.599 --> 19:52.960
No.

19:53.240 --> 19:55.040
You are defying the order.

19:55.200 --> 19:57.460
Does that even bother me?

19:57.480 --> 19:59.240
But this is a serious crime.

20:01.520 --> 20:02.839
I don't care.

20:05.879 --> 20:07.200
If I didn't come back

20:07.440 --> 20:08.980
on your wedding day,

20:09.000 --> 20:10.720
that would be a more serious crime.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.560
Mother.

20:15.839 --> 20:17.280
There is one thing

20:17.879 --> 20:19.639
I'm sure of in my life.

20:20.119 --> 20:21.199
What's that?

20:21.599 --> 20:23.280
I'm the most beautiful woman

20:24.000 --> 20:25.679
that ever walked the earth.

20:27.280 --> 20:29.639
Though someone is blind
and can't see me,

20:31.040 --> 20:32.679
that's not my problem.

20:39.839 --> 20:41.399
Who are you talking about?

20:46.440 --> 20:47.800
Never mind that.

20:48.079 --> 20:49.520
What I'm trying

20:49.639 --> 20:51.399
to tell you is,

20:51.919 --> 20:53.560
I must come to the Capital

20:54.720 --> 20:56.960
to groom you personally.

20:58.000 --> 20:59.599
In this world,

21:00.399 --> 21:03.839
if I allow someone else
to be prettier than me,

21:05.480 --> 21:07.280
it must be you.

21:11.879 --> 21:13.520
It must be today.

21:39.639 --> 21:41.240
Since infancy,

21:42.399 --> 21:44.280
you have been all alone

21:45.760 --> 21:47.240
and unhappy.

21:49.110 --> 21:51.200
Nothing can be done
to compensate you even now.

21:52.480 --> 21:53.919
But today,

21:56.280 --> 21:58.560
please let me do my duty as a mother.

22:02.040 --> 22:03.839
Let me see you

22:06.119 --> 22:08.399
to the next journey of your life.

22:11.480 --> 22:12.560
Mother.

22:13.480 --> 22:14.720
No tears.

22:16.240 --> 22:18.159
The makeup looks just perfect on you.

22:21.720 --> 22:22.800
Mother.

22:24.879 --> 22:28.359
Could you please stop fighting
with Fan Xian?

22:38.520 --> 22:39.839
Look at you.

22:40.760 --> 22:41.919
So beautiful.

22:44.559 --> 22:46.760
You are prettier than me, my daughter.

23:13.839 --> 23:15.280
I have done

23:16.919 --> 23:18.399
what I have to do.

23:25.440 --> 23:26.839
Where are you going?

23:29.119 --> 23:30.599
I came here secretly,

23:30.839 --> 23:32.679
so I must leave secretly.

23:35.119 --> 23:36.200
Wan'er,

23:37.720 --> 23:40.000
I haven't lived a life like yours.

23:42.520 --> 23:43.879
I envy you.

24:06.879 --> 24:07.960
Stop right there.

24:14.240 --> 24:15.760
From today on,

24:16.720 --> 24:18.200
forget me

24:19.919 --> 24:21.879
completely.

24:35.639 --> 24:36.960
I'm so glad

24:38.559 --> 24:40.040
that you came.

25:04.119 --> 25:05.379
Where are you going?

25:05.399 --> 25:06.760
Where else could I go?

25:06.919 --> 25:08.379
Leave them alone.

25:08.399 --> 25:09.639
I don't want you to worry,

25:09.639 --> 25:11.099
so you are coming with me.

25:11.119 --> 25:12.339
I can't fight.

25:12.359 --> 25:13.660
If anything happens,

25:13.680 --> 25:15.159
I'm all yours.

25:49.480 --> 25:51.000
Why are all the horses here?

25:51.000 --> 25:53.159
Go that way.
Park the carriage over there.

25:53.520 --> 25:54.879
Misters, would you mind

25:54.879 --> 25:56.399
moving your horses forward?

25:56.800 --> 25:58.260
All the carriages should be over there.

25:58.280 --> 25:59.399
Go that way.

26:02.440 --> 26:03.099
Misters,

26:03.119 --> 26:05.059
please take the horses

26:05.079 --> 26:06.720
over there.

26:07.399 --> 26:08.720
Thank you so much.

26:16.240 --> 26:17.280
Look at the grandeur.

26:17.280 --> 26:18.639
Exactly.

26:19.240 --> 26:20.619
How grand.

26:20.639 --> 26:22.379
It must be someone important.

26:22.399 --> 26:23.679
It must be.

26:25.119 --> 26:26.119
Impressive.

26:26.119 --> 26:27.579
Right.

26:27.599 --> 26:29.320
What a grandeur.

26:36.240 --> 26:38.099
Greetings, Your Highness.

26:38.119 --> 26:39.420
He's the Crown Prince.

26:39.440 --> 26:40.440
You are...

26:40.440 --> 26:42.000
Wang Qinian.

26:44.200 --> 26:45.800
Those who carry gifts, come with me.

26:46.480 --> 26:48.159
I know what you are going to say.

26:48.879 --> 26:51.119
This is a family banquet.
No need to follow me.

26:52.919 --> 26:53.780
Who has arrived?

26:53.800 --> 26:54.919
- Move!
- Well...

26:56.079 --> 26:57.760
Move!

26:58.240 --> 26:59.180
Move!

26:59.200 --> 27:00.280
Clear the way!

27:05.660 --> 27:06.700
An urgent missive from Northern Qi.

27:06.700 --> 27:08.040
[Imperial Edict]
Urgent missive from the border army!

27:08.040 --> 27:09.030
Did Northern Qi intrude on the border?

27:09.040 --> 27:10.460
No, it doesn't concern the warfare.

27:10.480 --> 27:12.760
It's a letter for Mr. Fan
from Northern Qi.

27:14.319 --> 27:15.819
Is it appropriate

27:15.839 --> 27:17.579
to send a private letter
on an urgent delivery?

27:17.599 --> 27:18.370
The sender is

27:18.390 --> 27:19.879
the Emperor of Northern Qi.

27:29.280 --> 27:31.520
There's no way the groom
is serving us the liquor.

27:31.559 --> 27:33.790
Do away with formalities
in the family banquet.

27:37.440 --> 27:38.339
What's wrong?

27:38.359 --> 27:39.639
I'm the groom.

27:39.960 --> 27:41.359
Why are you more nervous?

27:42.720 --> 27:43.800
Fan.

27:44.320 --> 27:45.400
Come with me.

27:54.240 --> 27:57.119
Is Miss Ruoruo in?

27:57.440 --> 27:58.520
Why?

27:58.680 --> 28:00.919
You have already gotten drunk
before even drinking.

28:02.119 --> 28:03.420
News from the palace says

28:03.440 --> 28:06.040
my wedding with Ruoruo
is right after your wedding.

28:06.040 --> 28:07.399
Ruoruo won't marry you.

28:08.800 --> 28:09.880
Fan Xian,

28:09.940 --> 28:11.260
this is the imperial decree.

28:11.280 --> 28:12.930
It doesn't matter

28:12.950 --> 28:14.180
whether or not Ruoruo and I want it.

28:14.200 --> 28:17.359
But she doesn't want to marry you.

28:17.680 --> 28:18.819
Is she trying

28:18.839 --> 28:20.280
to defy the decree, then?

28:24.280 --> 28:25.480
To be honest,

28:25.639 --> 28:27.960
I have always liked Ruoruo.

28:28.440 --> 28:31.280
Why don't we try to get along?

28:31.319 --> 28:33.639
You know what I am like.

28:35.839 --> 28:37.439
What about Yuan Meng?

28:38.559 --> 28:39.760
Yuan Meng...

28:39.960 --> 28:40.940
Yuan Meng

28:40.960 --> 28:43.280
is only a silly past.

28:45.800 --> 28:47.359
I'm not involved

28:47.440 --> 28:49.240
in the Baoyue Pleasure House at all.

28:51.760 --> 28:53.000
I believe you,

28:55.520 --> 28:57.000
and I forgave you.

28:58.559 --> 29:00.679
But Ruoruo won't marry you.

29:01.879 --> 29:03.220
No one can defy

29:03.240 --> 29:05.180
the marriage appointed by His Majesty.

29:05.200 --> 29:06.639
Congratulations!

29:06.720 --> 29:07.919
Your Highness.

29:08.560 --> 29:09.819
Greetings, Your Highness.

29:09.839 --> 29:10.819
Chengru.

29:10.839 --> 29:11.740
Well,

29:11.760 --> 29:13.720
carry the things to the yard.

29:14.240 --> 29:16.079
Don't touch any bizarre thing
you see there.

29:16.079 --> 29:17.200
Did you hear me?

29:19.760 --> 29:21.660
I just came here

29:21.680 --> 29:24.040
to have a drink with my brothers.

29:25.359 --> 29:26.439
That thing,

29:27.000 --> 29:28.200
is it fixed?

29:28.960 --> 29:30.040
Yes, it's fixed.

29:30.870 --> 29:32.819
The little emperor of Northern Qi
wrote you a letter.

29:32.839 --> 29:33.460
Take a look at it.

29:33.480 --> 29:34.560
Mr. Fan.

29:46.319 --> 29:47.800
He is demanding updates.

29:48.240 --> 29:49.299
What does that mean?

29:49.319 --> 29:51.639
This little emperor enjoys
reading "Red Mansion".

29:51.940 --> 29:53.440
He only mentioned this in it?

29:55.040 --> 29:56.879
There are more.

29:57.680 --> 29:59.159
You may read it yourself.

30:12.440 --> 30:15.520
One of the Four Grandmasters, Ku He,

30:15.960 --> 30:17.240
intends to take

30:17.520 --> 30:20.079
Ruoruo as his "closed door" disciple.
[*Last disciple]

30:20.240 --> 30:22.379
Isn't Haitang Duoduo
his "closed door" disciple?

30:22.399 --> 30:23.460
It says here,

30:23.480 --> 30:24.540
"The door isn't fully shut,

30:24.560 --> 30:25.619
so he's closing it again."

30:25.639 --> 30:26.980
Does that even make a reason?

30:27.000 --> 30:28.819
The our Grandmasters
are exceptionally skilled,

30:28.839 --> 30:30.919
their thoughts are extraordinary.

30:35.000 --> 30:36.940
Deliver it to the palace
for His Majesty to decide.

30:36.960 --> 30:38.240
I will see to that now.

30:39.720 --> 30:40.800
Well,

30:40.879 --> 30:42.070
please take a seat.

30:43.040 --> 30:44.120
Fan.

30:49.196 --> 30:50.320
Fan.

30:50.559 --> 30:52.399
How did you manage this?

30:53.159 --> 30:55.439
Do you think
this marriage will continue?

30:55.760 --> 30:58.059
If the Four Grandmasters are involved,

30:58.079 --> 31:01.339
I'm afraid this marriage
won't proceed as planned.

31:01.359 --> 31:04.679
With the Four Grandmasters
above the monarch,

31:04.800 --> 31:06.720
do you think this is a good sign?

31:09.800 --> 31:11.359
But it has been the fact.

31:11.919 --> 31:13.960
I was just saying.
Don't take it too seriously.

31:13.980 --> 31:16.400
Hurry and take a seat.
The cold dishes will be served soon.

31:30.480 --> 31:32.279
Why is the street empty?

31:32.299 --> 31:33.379
Exactly.

31:33.440 --> 31:34.760
Why, indeed?

31:37.319 --> 31:39.159
You don't have to hold my hand.

31:39.200 --> 31:40.560
Xie Bi'an isn't here.

31:40.760 --> 31:43.180
I can only rely on you
if assassins show up.

31:43.200 --> 31:44.359
I'm only at ease

31:44.520 --> 31:46.000
when I hold your hand.

31:47.559 --> 31:49.320
I will protect you.

31:49.680 --> 31:51.280
But do keep your word,

31:51.440 --> 31:53.119
don't ruin Wan'er's wedding.

31:53.399 --> 31:55.439
If you can't believe me,

31:56.159 --> 31:57.639
kill me, then.

31:57.879 --> 32:00.859
Look, I'm all alone
and don't have martial arts skills.

32:00.879 --> 32:02.099
You can easily

32:02.119 --> 32:03.520
kill me.

32:05.159 --> 32:07.359
If you talk nonsense during the wedding,

32:07.440 --> 32:08.720
I will kill you.

32:10.200 --> 32:11.480
That's a deal, then.

32:12.200 --> 32:13.439
What deal?

32:13.680 --> 32:15.240
Either you protect me

32:15.319 --> 32:16.539
or kill me.

32:16.559 --> 32:18.000
My life

32:19.200 --> 32:20.879
is in your hands now.

32:31.399 --> 32:32.899
Now that you have married Wan'er,

32:32.919 --> 32:34.599
we are considered relatives.

32:34.680 --> 32:36.020
We are one family now.

32:36.040 --> 32:37.220
Chengru, to be honest with you,

32:37.240 --> 32:38.619
I'm so worried about him

32:38.639 --> 32:41.040
that I can't sleep for nights.

32:41.839 --> 32:43.540
What should we do

32:43.560 --> 32:45.399
about the debt of the Imperial Treasury?

32:45.720 --> 32:48.480
Surely, you are merciful.

32:49.520 --> 32:50.760
One more thing.

32:51.319 --> 32:54.139
I can see that Northern Qi
regards you highly.

32:54.159 --> 32:56.379
But then, the deep debt

32:56.399 --> 32:58.240
is our own state affair.

32:58.319 --> 33:00.819
We can't fill up the hole
with money from another state.

33:00.839 --> 33:02.200
This is a big no.

33:02.440 --> 33:03.819
Don't overthink, Your Highness.

33:03.839 --> 33:05.980
Even though this little emperor
loves "Red Mansion",

33:06.000 --> 33:07.780
he won't pay the debt
of over 20 million.

33:07.800 --> 33:10.200
No one in this universe
would demand updates like this.

33:10.399 --> 33:11.479
True, though.

33:11.800 --> 33:13.359
Speaking of which,

33:13.639 --> 33:16.040
what should we do about the debt?

33:16.800 --> 33:17.920
Today's Fan Xian's wedding.

33:17.940 --> 33:19.240
Let's not get into this.

33:19.399 --> 33:20.180
All right, let's drop it.

33:20.200 --> 33:21.639
One more word.

33:21.800 --> 33:23.540
Fortunately, that fellow is grounded.

33:23.560 --> 33:24.800
I can't image how trouble it could be

33:24.800 --> 33:26.320
if he comes.

33:27.319 --> 33:28.180
Mr. Fan,

33:28.200 --> 33:30.760
the Second Prince has come.

33:39.625 --> 33:41.895
[Fan's Residence]

33:43.359 --> 33:44.760
Luckily, I came without guards.

33:44.760 --> 33:46.819
Otherwise, they couldn't fit it here.

33:46.839 --> 33:49.760
He is not like you.
He's afraid of dying.

33:50.480 --> 33:52.520
I'm afraid of dying too,

33:52.839 --> 33:54.359
but that's not my greatest fear.

33:57.520 --> 33:58.940
What's your greatest fear, then?

33:58.960 --> 34:00.679
I fear

34:00.860 --> 34:02.200
an uneventful situation.

34:03.000 --> 34:04.240
It's boring.

34:05.040 --> 34:06.439
You're unbelievable.

34:20.315 --> 34:21.879
Mr. Fan

34:22.080 --> 34:24.419
invites you in.

34:24.439 --> 34:25.379
Today is a big day.

34:25.399 --> 34:26.519
Everyone is welcome.

34:26.519 --> 34:27.499
That's wonderful.

34:27.519 --> 34:29.600
I was worried he might shut me out.

34:55.810 --> 34:57.290
Please come in, Your Highness.

34:59.959 --> 35:01.120
Everyone is here.

35:02.640 --> 35:04.200
Greetings, Your Highness.

35:04.240 --> 35:05.720
No need for that, Chengze.

35:06.839 --> 35:07.959
You didn't bow.

35:11.160 --> 35:12.140
You see,

35:12.160 --> 35:14.180
Chengze came personally
for Fan Xian's wedding.

35:14.200 --> 35:16.359
You are indeed all heart.

35:17.280 --> 35:19.019
But if His Majesty reprimands you

35:19.039 --> 35:20.499
for having defied his decree,

35:20.519 --> 35:21.540
we brothers

35:21.560 --> 35:23.519
will bear it with you.

35:24.120 --> 35:25.980
Are you talking about the confinement?

35:26.000 --> 35:27.299
I asked for his permission.

35:27.319 --> 35:28.439
What...

35:28.720 --> 35:29.939
I requested

35:29.959 --> 35:31.339
a decree

35:31.359 --> 35:32.800
to attend Wan'er's wedding.

35:32.879 --> 35:34.519
That's great.

35:35.080 --> 35:37.080
I was worried for nothing.

35:37.479 --> 35:38.899
My bad.

35:38.919 --> 35:39.899
I shall drink to that.

35:39.919 --> 35:40.999
Me too.

35:43.720 --> 35:45.060
Well, what do you know?

35:45.080 --> 35:46.959
Such brotherhood does exist.

36:07.999 --> 36:09.190
Your wedding gift.

36:10.680 --> 36:11.760
Thank you.

36:12.160 --> 36:13.359
Open it.

36:21.640 --> 36:23.760
I prepared jewels at first.

36:23.760 --> 36:24.700
But I thought

36:24.720 --> 36:26.290
you had lots of those at home.

36:26.310 --> 36:27.939
So I chose something more direct.

36:27.959 --> 36:29.120
500,000 taels.

36:32.040 --> 36:33.240
This is too much.

36:33.560 --> 36:34.700
This barely makes a dent

36:34.720 --> 36:36.540
in the 20 million debt.

36:36.560 --> 36:38.039
I'm so worried for you.

36:38.319 --> 36:40.320
You two are truly brothers.

36:41.319 --> 36:42.399
Pardon?

36:42.680 --> 36:44.959
His Highness was worried for me too.

36:48.359 --> 36:51.439
I can never compare
to His Highness' compassion.

36:51.839 --> 36:54.380
Let's talk about the real business.

36:54.400 --> 36:56.060
You have a lot of things to take care of

36:56.080 --> 36:57.740
after taking over the Imperial Treasury.

36:57.760 --> 37:00.200
You need to venture into business.

37:00.760 --> 37:02.999
But it won't be easy for me
due to the debt.

37:02.999 --> 37:03.939
Don't worry.

37:03.959 --> 37:05.979
I have contacts
with many merchant families.

37:05.999 --> 37:07.640
They will humor me

37:08.280 --> 37:09.559
and offer help.

37:10.160 --> 37:11.100
Indeed.

37:11.120 --> 37:12.999
Chengze has a good intention.

37:13.439 --> 37:14.519
I sense a but.

37:18.160 --> 37:19.339
Merchants

37:19.359 --> 37:21.160
are profit-driven.

37:21.680 --> 37:22.920
If you take advantage of them now,

37:22.940 --> 37:24.620
how are you going to deal
with them later?

37:24.640 --> 37:27.320
If everyone meddles
in the Imperial Treasury,

37:27.399 --> 37:28.760
it will be troublesome.

37:31.200 --> 37:32.700
That being said,

37:32.720 --> 37:34.439
Chengze is different

37:34.839 --> 37:36.180
from those profit-driven merchants.

37:36.200 --> 37:37.819
Of course he bears a good will.

37:37.839 --> 37:39.839
You have a good assessment of people.

37:39.999 --> 37:42.180
But we can't let
the Imperial Treasury be ruined

37:42.200 --> 37:44.140
in the hands of Mr. Fan.

37:44.160 --> 37:45.220
Exactly.

37:45.240 --> 37:47.640
How could we not help
our brother-in-law?

37:47.640 --> 37:49.080
Even blood brothers

37:49.439 --> 37:51.320
want to kill each other.

37:51.680 --> 37:53.060
Your Highness,

37:53.080 --> 37:54.559
do you plan to cover the debt?

37:54.959 --> 37:57.140
If I could afford 20 million taels,

37:57.160 --> 37:58.220
this would be a trouble.

37:58.240 --> 38:00.200
Why did you even bring this up, then?

38:00.800 --> 38:02.180
If you have time

38:02.200 --> 38:04.399
tomorrow or the day after,

38:04.600 --> 38:06.519
come to my residence.

38:06.519 --> 38:08.439
We can think of solutions.

38:09.039 --> 38:09.830
Wonderful.

38:09.850 --> 38:12.030
From then on, the Imperial Inspectorate
and the Imperial Treasury

38:12.039 --> 38:13.760
will be in your pocket.

38:14.720 --> 38:16.379
Chengze, this is no joke.

38:16.399 --> 38:18.559
I wouldn't dare fraternize
with officials

38:18.999 --> 38:20.559
like you do.

38:29.399 --> 38:30.860
You should consider me too.

38:30.880 --> 38:32.140
You don't have to serve me.

38:32.160 --> 38:33.979
This is just favor trading between us.

38:33.999 --> 38:35.439
Yes, favors trading

38:35.440 --> 38:36.479
could bring endless threats.

38:36.479 --> 38:38.839
It's better than being a lackey.

38:48.080 --> 38:49.479
Oops, it slipped again.

38:54.120 --> 38:55.519
I just keep one.

38:55.839 --> 38:56.760
50,000 taels will cost me

38:56.770 --> 38:59.180
at least seven impeachments
from the Imperial Procuratorate.

38:59.200 --> 39:01.399
Don't jinx me on my big day.

39:03.959 --> 39:06.120
Your Highness,
have you heard of "honeymoon"?

39:06.919 --> 39:08.439
Is that a dessert or something?

39:08.760 --> 39:09.740
No.

39:09.760 --> 39:10.819
It means

39:10.839 --> 39:12.760
Wan'er and I will be on a hiatus
after the wedding

39:12.760 --> 39:14.330
without any official business.

39:14.640 --> 39:17.140
I appreciate your offer,
but I won't visit

39:17.160 --> 39:18.640
the Eastern Palace.

39:22.800 --> 39:24.439
How do you plan

39:24.519 --> 39:26.899
to clear the debt without help?

39:26.919 --> 39:29.399
I don't want to talk about this
on such a fine day.

39:31.120 --> 39:31.700
Gentlemen,

39:31.720 --> 39:34.290
today is my first time
doing the wedding ritual.

39:34.310 --> 39:35.780
The auspicious hour is arriving soon.

39:35.800 --> 39:37.620
Why don't you all join us

39:37.640 --> 39:38.839
for the ceremony?

39:45.039 --> 39:48.160
The auspicious hour has arrived!

40:27.720 --> 40:29.540
Shouldn't the matchmaker
be holding this?

40:29.560 --> 40:31.220
I insisted.

40:31.240 --> 40:33.439
I must witness this important moment.

40:35.600 --> 40:37.640
Bonding twain hearts with a tie,

40:37.680 --> 40:39.919
and they shall never part.

41:58.640 --> 42:01.359
Wan'er, I want to tell you something.

42:02.519 --> 42:04.479
Young Master,

42:04.680 --> 42:07.140
you can tell her
when the ritual is over.

42:07.160 --> 42:08.280
No.

42:08.319 --> 42:09.959
I must say it now.

42:12.600 --> 42:13.680
Wan'er.

42:15.080 --> 42:16.260
There is something

42:16.280 --> 42:19.359
Father wants me to tell you
on your wedding day.

42:19.560 --> 42:20.800
What's it about?

42:28.080 --> 42:29.519
He wants

42:30.120 --> 42:31.559
you

42:31.959 --> 42:33.600
to look after Dabao.

42:38.600 --> 42:39.680
All right.

42:40.160 --> 42:41.479
I will.

42:42.359 --> 42:43.260
I'm done.

42:43.280 --> 42:44.180
Very good.

42:44.200 --> 42:44.819
I'm done!

42:44.839 --> 42:45.479
Yay! I'm done!

42:45.479 --> 42:46.600
Dabao is done.

42:46.600 --> 42:47.319
Yay!

42:47.319 --> 42:48.399
All right.

42:50.319 --> 42:51.919
Shall we start?

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.633
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.653 --> 44:10.893
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
